# Validation Procedure

## Verify Manager Assignment

Select several previously remediated users.

Example:

```powershell
az rest --method GET --url "https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/users/<GuestObjectID>/manager"
```

Expected Result:

Manager object is returned.

## Sampling Validation

Validate:

- First updated user
- Random user from middle
- Last updated user

## Count Validation

Run:

```powershell
($Results |
Where-Object {$_.HasManager -eq "No" -and $_.HasSponsor -eq "Yes"}).Count
```

Expected Result:

```text
0
```

## Reporting Validation

Export final report.

```powershell
$Results | Export-Csv "./GuestSponsorReport_Final.csv" -NoTypeInformation
```

Review for:

- Missing Managers
- Missing Sponsors
- Unexpected Values
